<div class="calculator-container">
  <h1 class="calculator-title">A1C to Average Blood Glucose Converter</h1>
  <p class="intro-text">Convert your A1C percentage to estimated average glucose levels in both mg/dL and mmol/L. Managing blood sugar often requires consistent supplement routines and medication schedules. <a href="pactcase.com/products/weekly-pill-organizer">Pact Case extra large pill organizer 7 day</a> helps you maintain the regularity needed for better glycemic control by organizing your daily supplements.</p>
  
  <div class="calculator-form">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="a1c">Your A1C Value (%)</label>
      <input type="number" id="a1c" placeholder="e.g., 6.5" min="4" max="14" step="0.1">
